  #line-at(90.024pt, 528.55pt, "Rh nanoparticles (b), and bare DNA‑origami on silica (c). The corresponding averaged SERS ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 546.55pt, "spectra (Fig. S4d) reveal distinct spectral profiles. The sample containing Rh nanoparticles (red ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 564.67pt, "line) exhibits pronounced enhancement across characteristic bands, while the sample without ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 582.79pt, "nanoparticles (blue line) and the bare DNA‑origami (green line) show significantly weaker signals, ")
